# VMESS Account Management Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = your_api_key_here

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create VMESS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vmess/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvmess",
  "exp": "30",
  "quota": "10GB",
  "ip_quota": "5"
}

### Check VMESS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vmess/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvmess"
}

### Renew VMESS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vmess/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvmess",
  "exp": "15"
}

### Delete VMESS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vmess/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvmess"
}

### Create VMESS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvmess2",
  "exp": "30",
  "quota": "10GB",
  "ip_quota": "5",
  "account_type": "vmess"
}

### Check VMESS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvmess2",
  "account_type": "vmess"
}

### Renew VMESS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvmess2",
  "exp": "15",
  "account_type": "vmess"
}

### Delete VMESS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvmess2",
  "account_type": "vmess"
}